[type     |-> "uniprocess", 
 name  |-> "A", 
 decls  |-> <<[var |-> "x", eqOrIn |-> "=", val |-> << "0" >>], 
              [var |-> "y", eqOrIn |-> "=", val |-> << "0" >>]>>,
 defs   |-> <<  >>,
 prcds  |-> <<>>,
 body  |-> <<[label |-> "L",
              stmts |-> <<[type |-> "when", 
                           exp |-> << "(col41) /\\", "(", "y", "=", "0", "(col49) \\/", "y", "=", "1", ")"
, "(col0) /\\", "TRUE" >>]>>], 
             [label |-> "E",
              stmts |-> <<[type |-> "skip"]>>]>>]